    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"disambig-see-also\"><i>See also:</i> <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%C3%A1p\" title=\"nháp\">nháp</a></b> <i>and</i> <b class=\"Latn\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%E1%BA%A5p\" title=\"nhấp\">nhấp</a></b></div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Vietnamese\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vietnamese</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Etymology\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Etymology</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Pronunciation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pronunciation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Verb\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verb</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Derived_terms\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Derived terms</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Anagrams\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anagrams</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Vietnamese\">Vietnamese</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<ul class=\"etymid\" id=\"Vietnamese:&#95;入\" data-lang=\"vi\" data-id=\"入\"></ul><p><a href=\"/wiki/Sino-Vietnamese\" title=\"Sino-Vietnamese\">Sino-Vietnamese</a>&#32;word from