nary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Vietnamese_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Vietnamese pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>:&#32;<span class=\"IPA nowrap\">[ɲəp̚˨˩˨]</span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r50165410\">.mw-parser-output .k-player .k-attribution{visibility:hidden}</style><table class=\"audiotable\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; list-style: none; line-height: 1em; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0;\"><tbody><tr><td>Audio <span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">(</span><span class=\"usage-label-accent\"><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanoi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Hanoi\">Hà Nội</a></span></span><span class=\"ib-brac qualifier-brac\">)</span><span class=\"ib-colon qualifier-colon\">:</span></td><td class=\"audiofile\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><audio id=\"mwe_player_0\" controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" data-mw-tmh=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" width=\"175\" style=\"width:175px;\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"LL-Q9199_(vie)-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nhập.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"wikimediacommons\"><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nh%E1%BA%ADp.wav/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nh%E1%BA%ADp.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9d/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nh%E1%BA%ADp.wav/LL-Q9199_%28vie%29-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nh%E1%BA%ADp.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio></span></span></td><td class=\"audiometa\" style=\"font-size: 80%;\">(<a href=\"/wiki/File:LL-Q9199_(vie)-Penn_Zero_MSSJ-nh%E1%BA%ADp.wav\" title=\"File:LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-nhập.wav\">file</a>)</td></tr></tbody></table></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Verb\">Verb</h3></div>\n<p><span class=\"headword-line\"><strong class=\"Latn headword\" lang=\"vi\">nhập</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ol><li>to <a href=\"/wiki/join\" title=\"join\">join</a> (a <a href=\"/wiki/group\" title=\"group\">group</a>)\n<dl><dd><div class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\"><b>nhập</b> hội&#47;bọn</i><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">to join an association/cohort</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></li>\n<li>to <a href=\"/wiki/take\" title=\"take\">take</a> <a href=\"/wiki/goods\" title=\"goods\">goods</a> into <a href=\"/wiki/stock\" title=\"stock\">stock</a>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\"><b>nhập</b> kho</i><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">to take goods into stock</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></li>\n<li><span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\"><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#clipping\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">clipping</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%E1%BA%ADp_kh%E1%BA%A9u#Vietnamese\" title=\"nhập khẩu\"><b>nhập</b> khẩu</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">“</span><span class=\"mention-gloss\">to <a href=\"/wiki/import\" title=\"import\">import</a></span><span class=\"mention-gloss-double-quote\">”</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span></span></span>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"nyms antonym\"><span style=\"font-size: smaller\">Antonym:</span> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/xu%E1%BA%A5t#Vietnamese\" title=\"xuất\">xuất</a></span></span></dd></dl></li>\n<li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">(</span><span class=\"ib-content label-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/occult\" title=\"occult\">occult</a></span><span class=\"ib-brac label-brac\">)</span></span> to <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\"><a href=\"/wiki/possess#English\" title=\"possess\">possess</a></span>\n<dl><dd><div class=\"h-usage-example\"><i class=\"Latn mention e-example\" lang=\"vi\">bị ma&#47;quỷ <b>nhập</b></i><dl><dd><span class=\"e-translation\">to be possessed by a ghost/demon</span></dd></dl></div></dd></dl></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading4\"><h4 id=\"Derived_terms\">Derived terms</h4></div>\n<div class=\"list-switcher-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-switcher\" data-toggle-category=\"derived terms\"><div class=\"term-list columns-bg ul-column-count\" data-column-count=\"3\"><ul><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/d%E1%BA%ABn_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"dẫn nhập\">dẫn nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/du_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"du nhập\">du nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91%C4%83ng_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"đăng nhập\">đăng nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C4%91%E1%BB%99t_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"đột nhập\">đột nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/gia_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"gia nhập\">gia nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/ho%C3%A0_nh%E1%BA%ADp#Vietnamese\" title=\"hoà nhập\">hoà nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ma_nh%E1%BA%ADp&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ma nhập (page does not exist)\">ma nhập</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%E1%BA%ADp_c%E1%BA%A3nh#Vietnamese\" title=\"nhập cảnh\">nhập cảnh</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%E1%BA%ADp_cu%E1%BB%99c#Vietnamese\" title=\"nhập cuộc\">nhập cuộc</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/nh%E1%BA%ADp_c%C6%B0#Vietnamese\" title=\"nhập cư\">nhập cư</a></span></li><li><span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"vi\"><a href=\"/wiki/n